      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:ibqmkv'
    '|b||The trip-time sign: it changes what drivers see, forbids nothing and costs nothing. The charge changes the price, the ban removes the option.':
